a737943f1b","sessionId":"30615302-c57d-4349-86d5-e63cde66f008","text":"Initial `digiplot` implementation.\n`alr init` failures x2\n`hed` ERE paren escaping failure x4\ngrep match failure\n`hed` invalid hash address x2\n`hgrep` regex paren escaping failure. Accidentally used ERE escape with BRE regex x2\n`hgrep` match failure\n`hed` hash match faiure\n","timestamp":1779622339677},{"commentId":"a949b666-12d8-4143-a48b-f2f17a03e340","sessionId":"44c17312-af75-458d-a6df-733354b2ef77","text":"Accidentally used GPT-5 mini model","timestamp":1779636888756},{"commentId":"b027c304-dd6d-42fd-9d2d-ecbf50e4f5a0","sessionId":"492fedf3-bf30-4cd1-87bd-8a0a4a3cfe51","text":"Accidentally used GPT-5 mini model","timestamp":1779636888756},{"commentId":"b05f92ff-ddf0-4070-8f08-badd9df02cd9","sessionId":"e6f28a3f-b436-435f-96ca-2fa1b409966e","text":"Accidentally used GPT-5 mini model","timestamp":1779636888756},{"commentId":"dfafb89f-4304-4a99-8c69-a25b3822df91","sessionId":"3c6d1331-552f-4ce9-9f64-5c8734335ee9","text":"New feature: Requirements update, spec update, and implementation","timestamp":1779637998119},{"commentId":"2eb829a1-e365-44e4-96e5-a0856389919c","sessionId":"473cac6e-a83c-4c38-8e5f-5f94f1c86a30","text":"New feature -- EWMA Chart: Requirements update, spec update, implementation and debugging","timestamp":1779638187235},{"commentId":"5f1874d3-3ea8-4026-aafb-a5c939373d77","sessionId":"f713bb17-cadd-46fe-b172-65f7accaa9c7","text":"Feature implementation with spec and requirements updates done previously","timestamp":1779700960170},{"commentId":"4d922811-c26b-45bd-b354-acbd1828553c","sessionId":"0fdbe403-92c8-4886-98eb-3809ce44c4e2","text":"hgrep regex match failure\n`hed` regex match substitution failures  x2\n`hed` no match for hash address x2\n`hed` unknown command","timestamp":1779701276448},{"commentId":"1ea9e2a2-7323-482b-9ffd-695d6cf359eb","sessionId":"101eba66-22d5-4d5d-b6b3-5fc85e384558","text":"`hed` regex match failure\nbuild failure x2","timestamp":1779701388435},{"commentId":"c249c904-2878-4e11-ac3e-0590d646c893","sessionId":"ab18e9b2-054d-4b51-82cd-facfa356f47e","text":"`hed` regex match failure x3\nbuild failure","timestamp":1779701448846},{"commentId":"2453d411-1fb8-4dca-ac76-e8a5e58d261f","sessionId":"f22b7d5f-ae74-4504-b2e0-3392aa5c4cb7","text":"`hed` invalid address x3\n`hed` no match for hash address\n`hed` ambiguous hash address x2\n`hgrep` match failure x2\n","timestamp":1779701677985},{"commentId":"7a20c60d-96ce-4043-b4c6-220237d1b252","sessionId":"ab9bcf6d-4840-438e-a797-9e210178eae3","text":"`hgrep` match failure x7\n","timestamp":1779701829519},{"commentId":"3d56e580-cfbd-4fce-90d1-8397fb761a92","sessionId":"39126cf5-647d-44ab-8766-27d21355b0b7","text":"Made improvements to `hed` and `hed-tools` skill that should hopefully improve regex substitution failure rate.","timestamp":1779701936627},{"commentId":"109b3677-a9c5-41e1-aa9c-22f1f7a8473c","sessionId":"4f1f6a85-5dd7-42bb-cfc5-03cabe86766b","text":"Mistakenly used GPT-5 mini model. It generates a lot of thinking tokens, aparrently","timestamp":1779702664748},{"commentId":"688a8b1a-05b7-4983-a245-3c9b635be344","sessionId":"99ee6695-1a2e-4a4e-3f68-216c60ee999c","text":"Forked previous GPT-5 mini session that had a lot of pre-existing thinking tokens","timestamp":1779702754588},{"commentId":"fa163892-c8d9-4b29-ac1e-533997957d53","sessionId":"e4c215df-b1a9-4028-a0a1-9e470f622fe3","text":"Git status and git diff seem to generate a surprising amount of tokens","timestamp":1779703122162},{"commentId":"91634582-820a-413d-a6c7-fbc130f2288f","sessionId":"f5d98306-6fe8-4696-9283-f3f082c2b63a","text":"Lots of targeted source reads for debugging seems to have resulted in a large amount of tokens","timestamp":1779703273058},{"commentId":"d76cae42-6dff-4e24-a569-d3e46b43742f","sessionId":"a7288301-ec20-49cc-93c2-4f72b106780b","text":"Git status and git diff generate a lot of tokens","timestamp":1779703335598},{"commentId":"c0096a29-b869-4727-9769-4c17557a3668","sessionId":"e4c215df-b1a9-4028-a0a1-9e470f622fe3","text":"Scratch the last comment on tool output token use. This MR blip is due to the prevous session","timestamp":1779703430311},{"commentId":"9eabd02e-aea1-48c6-b7b8-5547b77b5bd0","sessionId":"f5d98306-6fe8-4696-9283-f3f082c2b63a","text":"Scratch last comment. This is due to unusually large amount of tool output tokens from the last session.","timestamp":1779703476513},{"commentId":"521edbbf-7cad-485f-98ca-0483ae8055e4","sessionId":"a7288301-ec20-49cc-93c2-4f72b106780b","text":"Scratch the last comment, the MR tool call result tokens blip is due to the previous session generating a lot of tool call output.","timestamp":1779703593140},{"commentId":"a0e4ced3-0b16-4689-bad3-5be4e732ee48","sessionId":"44c17312-af75-458d-a6df-733354b2ef77","text":"Cancelled mid run, it appears","timestamp":1779703748583},{"commentId":"86495e63-5a18-4350-8b33-d8a2e7119388","sessionId":"4f1f6a85-5dd7-42bb-cfc5-03cabe86766b","text":"This was forked from the previous session. I think a run was started but it was cancelled nearly instantly due to it having the wrong model.","timestamp":1779703857541},{"commentId":"3273a85e-d256-4539-99b6-450047048a98","sessionId":"99ee6695-1a2e-4a4e-3f68-216c60ee999c","text":"Forked previous session with the correct model","timestamp":1779703908227},{"commentId":"a5dbdd0c-fecc-4c75-add6-45ec62c2f0a2","sessionId":"8f4109a9-2132-4f17-a199-64d7ac94c58d","text":"Intermediate tool call results are not cached! We did an expensive read (`info ed`) early in the conversation and this was repeatedly read throughout.","timestamp":1779705747788},{"commentId":"191d0c2a-9360-4a33-b446-5f3509a4cf2a","sessionId":"8f4109a9-2132-4f17-a199-64d7ac94c58d","text":"I mean that it was passed uncached as input tokens at every turn","timestamp":1779705777079},{"commentId":"8ea2f9f1-e5f0-4915-8484-35efec492ec9","sessionId":"8f4109a9-2132-4f17-a199-64d7ac94c58d","text":"The previous comments should be ignored. They are due to an incorrect understanding of how caching is performed.","timestamp":1779707417301},{"commentId":"1b8a54f9-715c-4e67-8636-dcf4695f945c","sessionId":"8f4109a9-2132-4f17-a199-64d7ac94c58d","text":"Large input files combined with user prompting delays invalidating the cache led to large input token usage.","timestamp":1779711034945},{"commentId":"9b49f4df-f25c-4029-848f-050ad8ddcc46","sessionId":"f5a1e50b-eba3-478c-8a7f-37a64f213ac0","text":"A thorough investigation reveals no clear cause of the input token usage spike","timestamp":1779712271036},{"commentId":"2edf0089-d518-4fc9-882f-cab1937479a9","sessionId":"30615302-c57d-4349-86d5-e63cde66f008","text":"The session accumulated ~225K tokens of context across 255 turns due to a 28.5-minute idle gap expiring Anthropic's 5-minute cache TTL, which invalidated the cache prefix \u2014 an effect compounded by a dangling \"continue\" message left in the JSONL from a hung coyote instance, which permanently altered the conversation prefix that Anthropic had cached, forcing the entire ~94K-token history to be re-sent as fresh (uncached) tokens for the next 16 turns.\n\nWe fixed the root cause by deferring persistence of the user message until the first successful assistant response, so a crash or hang before any reply leaves no orphaned message in the JSONL \u2014 meaning a reloaded session presents Anthropic with exactly the same conversation prefix it previously cached.","timestamp":1779713814860}],"estimationMethod":"classical","ewmaL":3.00000000000000E+00,"ewmaWeight":2.00000000000000E-01,"iChartBoxCox":{"enabled":false,"fixedLambda":0.00000000000000E+00,"lambdaSource":"fixed"},"modelFilter":[],"name":"Coyote Dev","setupSessionIds":["c578cad2-1016-4d56-8711-ed7915513438","36e0df59-b0ad-4917-b430-69bcb485f28c","7ebd9a18-087b-48ed-bd56-6bdf721dfedb","c501ce30-d5e6-4ba9-81eb-afeb05fe75fa","4e13d7be-5025-4f71-90eb-3c700b8e67c3","ee3d6ae8-d25a-4042-8154-033a36fde3d0","bd435b95-6477-4ddf-be8f-59859c5d74c5","4f2fd7f5-e000-48e8-a1c6-1ed986db7f39","f12